  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Effectiveness, Accountability and Reform (HEAR) - UN</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide core funding to six humanitarian agencies of the UN - Office for the Co-ordination of Humanitarian Affairs (OCHA), United Nations High Commissioner for Refugees (UNHCR), World Food Programme (WFP), United Nations Children&apos;s Emergency Fund (UNICEF), International Organisation of Migration (IOM) and Food and Agriculture Organisation (FAO). This core funding will support greater scale and reach in life-saving humanitarian assistance while strengthening efforts to prevent further suffering by anticipating future shocks, building resilience, protecting civilians and prioritising assistance to those in greatest need.</narrative>
  </description>
